# Static asset headers (ADR-0006/0007). Up to 100 rules; CI checks the count.
# The Content-Security-Policy is not here: it is a meta tag written into each page after the build, with the hashes of that
# page's inline scripts (ADR-0014, scripts/inject-csp.mts). A header cannot carry per-page hashes within 100 rules.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()

/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/maplibre/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
